# Files that must never be served from the public website.
# Vercel applies this list when building deployments from GitHub.
.git
.gitignore
.vercelignore
tools/
scripts/
docs/
references/
review-required/
source-masters-do-not-publish/
website-assets/source-reference/
*.md
*.txt
!robots.txt
*.zip
*.part
*.ps1
*.docx
